{"date":"2026-10-03","on_shelf":[],"presented_event_with_attribution":"Sunil says: “Chai fixes what files can’t, sir. Sit, breathe, don't rush the steam.” He gestures to the plastic stool and wipes the counter again.","prior_record_files":{"2026-10-02":"cf7a480104e051a2d1be3dbcabed4381a58ef96ec30bdc6002134b76cbd995c8"},"reference":"088b8f4ba7356bc04a49672e96671be50b4ce3ef3f1dea7b9c8fed9aebbf706b","time":"09:00","typed_records":[{"amount":300,"canonical_id":null,"creditor":"the dhobi","direction":"out","id":"2026-10-03:payment:5f0510f65c08c4bb:1","item":"The dhobi","kind":"payment","medium":"cash","payer":null,"place":"home","settled":true,"source":{"collection":"entries","index":0,"sha256":"5f0510f65c08c4bbe235c71a07c07d442d402358f2594de234a43a8f129ac960"},"time":"05:57"},{"id":"2026-10-03:statement:893d0a5cf56642d6:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Ramesh","source":{"collection":"entries","index":4,"sha256":"893d0a5cf56642d6c019d15c8ca1896824cdd2fa8d29b8fe5f86ad55b830afd5"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"06:30","verified":false,"words":"Ramesh, has any paper come from the Directorate, or any message from Shri Hegde, since yesterday? And breakfast at seven, please, when it is ready."},{"id":"2026-10-03:statement:7a510431a74347ab:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Hegel","source":{"collection":"entries","index":5,"sha256":"7a510431a74347abe2a82c0f076b89bc8b6c21aa0fb3a5426924fb87605f28d0"},"speaker":"Ramesh","time":"06:30","verified":false,"words":"No papers, sir. The office is closed on weekends. Breakfast will be ready at seven sharp."},{"id":"2026-10-03:statement:b2b12f3d098e6a1a:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Ramesh","source":{"collection":"entries","index":7,"sha256":"b2b12f3d098e6a1a7a087fa5e3cb0c4bb2377aa3366388b52896e53b52771cee"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"06:40","verified":false,"words":"Seven, then. Keep the tea strong, and let the file wait for Monday."},{"id":"2026-10-03:statement:03bdc65b6ad5e171:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Hegel","source":{"collection":"entries","index":8,"sha256":"03bdc65b6ad5e17159e79631bb5cb638a341cad64fb21abbb983d451eb04d106"},"speaker":"Ramesh","time":"06:40","verified":false,"words":"Yes sir. Tea will be strong."},{"id":"2026-10-03:statement:ee4770b4fd76c911:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Ramesh","source":{"collection":"entries","index":11,"sha256":"ee4770b4fd76c911d0bc128441bf4fb56a387df5153389f9ede3eb9da20349c6"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"07:00","verified":false,"words":"Very good, Ramesh. Set it here, with the tea strong as you say, and I will be gone before the heat comes."},{"id":"2026-10-03:statement:782cfe81f35afa0b:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Hegel","source":{"collection":"entries","index":12,"sha256":"782cfe81f35afa0bb8c4dc0f9301d6e2d340e45074f5c926d9365d2818ecc6a2"},"speaker":"Ramesh","time":"07:00","verified":false,"words":"Yes sir. I’ll bring it out in a moment."},{"id":"2026-10-03:statement:88d6b422df9337b7:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Ramesh","source":{"collection":"entries","index":14,"sha256":"88d6b422df9337b7063afb34794dc05372451bcf3aac279e6ae3e9a3f9a45cea"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"07:30","verified":false,"words":"Thank you, Ramesh; set it here, and leave the file on the table as well."},{"id":"2026-10-03:statement:439d3beabf806298:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Hegel","source":{"collection":"entries","index":15,"sha256":"439d3beabf806298da32b060d9000abece7c89c695b3ddabcee394ad138e6ae8"},"speaker":"Ramesh","time":"07:30","verified":false,"words":"Yes sir. The file is on the left, just as you left it."},{"id":"2026-10-03:statement:35b1e64e63042d00:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Ramesh","source":{"collection":"entries","index":17,"sha256":"35b1e64e63042d00b1e13eb73f313e85026fd688fd0b0cb74c33274b4313ae7b"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"08:00","verified":false,"words":"Very well, Ramesh. Leave it as it is; I will be back before the heat. And set nothing on the table today that is not for me."},{"id":"2026-10-03:statement:df630468b80eb4fa:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Hegel","source":{"collection":"entries","index":18,"sha256":"df630468b80eb4fa4624a22f534d1053f7bd555ad881842dc23b546e3d8d1fb7"},"speaker":"Ramesh","time":"08:00","verified":false,"words":"Yes sir. Nothing else will be touched."},{"id":"2026-10-03:event:56d1536700b830a9:1","kind":"event","name":"Sunil","place":"lodhi","role":"chai seller","source":{"collection":"entries","index":19,"sha256":"56d1536700b830a9a403ec874bcf75b6fcafd8f830d06c54cd18d1f9ca01da41"},"time":"08:20","type":"people"},{"id":"2026-10-03:statement:0baec9e5b2511efc:1","kind":"statement","place":"lodhi","recipient":"Sunil","source":{"collection":"entries","index":21,"sha256":"0baec9e5b2511efcca1c09f3849e5ba0d59c9244c09c1e691471f69eae0bdfa2"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"08:20","verified":false,"words":"One chai, please. I am a new man in this house, and I have come to think, not to be hurried."},{"id":"2026-10-03:statement:24f3efbf3d80a86a:1","kind":"statement","place":"lodhi","recipient":"Hegel","source":{"collection":"entries","index":22,"sha256":"24f3efbf3d80a86a8858cb5b5b64f961a9965cc22ca3ed0ed2d240a605f91c80"},"speaker":"Sunil","time":"08:20","verified":false,"words":"Twenty rupees, sir. Sit on the plastic stool, don't stand there like a statue; the steam is good for the head, even if the road dust isn't."},{"amount":20,"canonical_id":null,"creditor":null,"direction":"out","id":"2026-10-03:payment:685f97ef343e8eda:1","item":"Chai from the stall at the Lodhi Road gate","kind":"payment","medium":"cash","payer":null,"place":"lodhi","settled":true,"source":{"collection":"entries","index":23,"sha256":"685f97ef343e8eda1593a19487b0f2e405b467a27a2d95302bd40e7aeddf06bd"},"time":"08:20"},{"id":"2026-10-03:statement:7a9c41ed20e6945f:1","kind":"statement","place":"lodhi","recipient":"Sunil","source":{"collection":"entries","index":25,"sha25